{
  "Name": "Harvest_Feast_Host",
  "$Comment": [
    "The Feast Host's conversation, everything the host says in the Forgotten Temple while Harvest Feast",
    "runs. The host contracts everything: I'm, it's, don't.",
    "",
    "HOW A SCREEN IS PICKED. Start is walked in a fixed order: First (top to bottom), then a quest that is",
    "READY to hand in, then one the host can OFFER, then one that is ACTIVE, then Then, then Fallback.",
    "First holds three things. The off-season line comes first and shows only while the feast is off (a",
    "visit after a command ends it, or a server owner who stands the host somewhere all year), and its",
    "only answer is goodbye. The greeting shows until the hail spends it. The board line shows once a day",
    "(Once with Period Daily, turning over at midnight UTC) and is skipped while the player has something",
    "to hand in. Quests holds one row per quest, the questline first, so the questline wins a tie with a",
    "daily. Then shows the after-feast line once this year's feast is done.",
    "",
    "THE BOARD LINE AND FAVOR. The board line comes in four wordings, one per band of favor with the host,",
    "highest first, so the first that applies is the player's own rank: Revered, Honored, Friendly, then",
    "the plain one, which is also what shows while the reputation is switched off. All four share one",
    "daily Once through OnceId, so whichever wording a player hears spends the line for the day, and a rank",
    "climbed later that day does not bring it back. Their Actions pay a little favor with the host when",
    "the player finishes the line, whichever way they leave it.",
    "",
    "THE SEASON. A conversation has no Season leaf, so every option that opens the board or the stall",
    "carries the Factor condition ziggfreedcommon:feature Harvest_Feast_Live, Min 1: while the feast is off",
    "they are not offered, and nobody is sent to a screen that opens closed.",
    "",
    "THE TABLE AND THE TOUR. The shared meal (harvest_feast_shared_meal) and the invitation tour",
    "(harvest_feast_invitations) have rows like any quest. The line a player uses to invite somebody is",
    "not in this file: DialogueExtensions/SeasonsOfOrbis/Harvest_Feast_Invitation.json adds it to every",
    "other character's conversation and leaves this one out, since nobody invites the cook to the cook's",
    "own table.",
    "",
    "THE FOOTER. Most screens pull in the feast_footer group: hand-ins, the quest list, the board, the",
    "stall, How do we stand? (it opens the Reputation page, and shows once the player has any favor with",
    "the host), the Almanac (only while the Almanac is switched on), two lore lines and goodbye.",
    "",
    "The greeting's memory is kept per world family, ForgottenTemple, the one place the host stands."
  ],
  "Header": [ "ActiveObjective" ],
  "Memories": {
    "feast_host_greeted": { "Where": { "GameplayConfig": [ "ForgottenTemple" ] } }
  },
